## KEY INSIGHTS FROM IMPLEMENTATION

### 1. Tax Efficiency Can Reverse Rankings
Example from documentation:
- Residential: +8% gross, -18.25% net (after 30-day tax)
- Commercial: +12% gross, -25.05% net (after 30-day tax)
- Lower gross return wins due to tax efficiency!

### 2. Portfolio Construction Impact
Tax-efficient portfolio (Residential/Industrial weighted):
- Average tax burden: 28% per 30-day cycle

Tax-naive portfolio (Commercial weighted):
- Average tax burden: 37% per 30-day cycle

**Difference: 9% × 3 cycles = 27% of portfolio value over 100 days!**

### 3. Break-Even Analysis
Commercial must outperform Residential by >10.8% to justify tax burden.
This creates clear decision framework for players.

### 4. Strategic Timing
Tax rates increase on days 25, 50, 75.
Smart players will:
- Pay taxes before rate increases
- Or sell/rebuy to reset tax clock
- Balance transaction costs (2%) vs tax savings

